  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Promoting Inclusive and Equitable Quality Education for all children in the Islamic Republic of Iran.</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">With a view to jointly support the Government of the Islamic Republic of Iran towards the implementation of the overarching SDG4 goal, the purpose of this collaboration between the UNICEF Country Office in Iran and UNESCO Tehran Cluster Office is to co-organize event and activities, subject to agreement by the Government. These activities are building on the activities under the previous UN to UN agreement. They are as follows: 
1)Disaster Preparedness Education for Children with Special Needs and Disabilities (2nd phase)
2)Female Afghan Teachers Training (Scale-up)</narrative>
  </description>
